<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia's Costello plans briefing.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia's Costello plans briefing.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Treasurer Peter Costello will hold a news conference at 10 a.m. (2300 GMT), his office said.</p>
<p>Costello is expected to discuss the 0.5 percentage point monetary easing announced by the Reserve Bank earlier today.</p>
<p>-- Canberra Bureau 61-6 273-2730</p>
